# Force textual diffs for Rust sources.
#
# runtime/src/inference/structured/json_schema.rs embeds a literal NUL inside
# a raw string — the JSON grammar's control-character range
# `char ::= [^"\\<NUL>-<0x1F>]`. That is semantically correct and cannot be
# written as an escape inside `r#"..."#`, but git's binary heuristic keys on
# the NUL and stops diffing the file, so a 43 KB core source became
# unreviewable ("Bin 39417 -> 42956 bytes"). This restores diff and blame.
*.rs diff
